/// English catalog text → Chinese.
let providerTextChinese: [String: String] = [
    "A Coding Plan key/base is isolated from pay-as-you-go. Mixing them can charge the pay-as-you-go account.": "Coding Plan 的 key/base 与按量计费相互隔离。混用可能从按量计费账户扣费。",
    "A Token Plan key/base is isolated from both Coding Plan and pay-as-you-go. Mixing them can use the wrong quota or billing path.": "Token Plan 的 key/base 与 Coding Plan 和按量计费都相互隔离。混用可能用错额度或计费路径。",
    "A bot token grants full control of that bot and has no scopes. Create a dedicated bot and grant it only the chat membership/admin rights it needs.": "bot token 拥有该 bot 的完全控制权，且没有 scope。创建专用 bot，只授予它所需的聊天成员/管理员权限。",
    "API keys remain valid until revoked.": "API Key 在撤销前一直有效。",
    "Always a Restricted key (rk_…), never the Secret key (sk_…): set each resource to None except the ones the task needs (Read where Read is enough). Start in sandbox (rk_test_) and only create a live key when the task really goes live. Balance: Read lets KeyKeeper verify it.": "始终使用 Restricted key（rk_…），绝不使用 Secret key（sk_…）：除任务所需的资源外，每项资源都设为 None（所需资源中 Read 够用的设为 Read）。先从 sandbox（rk_test_）开始，只有任务真正上线时才创建 live key。Balance: Read 可让 KeyKeeper 验证该 key。",
    "Choose 3 hours, 1/7/30 days, a custom date, or never; prefer the shortest practical value.": "可选 3 小时、1/7/30 天、自定义日期或永不过期；优先选择实际可行的最短期限。",
    "Choose Custom Access and enable only Mail Send for a sending app. Do not use Full Access or Billing Access.": "发信应用选择 Custom Access，只启用 Mail Send。不要使用 Full Access 或 Billing Access。",
    "Choose Custom Access and enable only Mail Send. Use the EU API base for this regional subuser.": "选择 Custom Access，只启用 Mail Send。此区域 subuser 使用 EU API 基础地址。",
    "Client secrets expire on the date chosen at creation.": "Client secret 在创建时所选的日期到期。",
    "Create Custom Token: permissions at Read where possible, Zone Resources = Specific zone (never All zones), and a TTL. Use an account-owned token only if the task needs it (it verifies at a different endpoint).": "创建 Custom Token：权限尽量设为 Read，Zone Resources = Specific zone（绝不选 All zones），并设置 TTL。只有任务需要时才使用账户拥有的 token（它在另一个 endpoint 验证）。",
    "Create a key with Restricted permissions: only the capabilities the task needs (usually Model capabilities: Write). Not All.": "创建权限为 Restricted 的 key：只开启任务所需的能力（通常是 Model capabilities: Write）。不要选 All。",
    "Create a key with only Apple Push Notifications service enabled. Use topic restrictions where Apple offers them.": "创建只启用 Apple Push Notifications service 的 key。Apple 提供 topic 限制时就使用。",
    "Create a separate key for this project with the lowest practical credit limit and an expiration.": "为此项目单独创建 key，设置实际可行的最低额度上限和到期时间。",
    "Create the key inside a project dedicated to this workload; project limits are the isolation boundary.": "在专用于此工作负载的项目内创建 key；项目限制就是隔离边界。",
    "Create the key restricted to the Gemini API only (the default). Standard unrestricted keys are rejected by Gemini API starting September 2026.": "创建仅限 Gemini API 的 key（默认即如此）。从 2026 年 9 月起，Gemini API 会拒绝未加限制的标准 key。",
    "Developer ID certificates have an Apple-issued expiration date; replace before expiry.": "Developer ID 证书有 Apple 规定的到期日期；到期前更换。",
    "Expiry is chosen at creation (1 day to 1 year, or none). A token that leaks to a public repo is revoked automatically.": "到期时间在创建时选择（1 天到 1 年，或不设到期）。泄露到公开仓库的 token 会被自动撤销。",
    "Fine-grained token: Repository access = Only select repositories (the ones the task touches), and only the permissions the task needs (e.g. Contents: Read). Leave everything else at No access. Expiry: 30 days or less.": "Fine-grained token：Repository access = Only select repositories（选任务涉及的仓库），且只授予任务所需的权限（如 Contents: Read）。其余全部保持 No access。有效期：30 天或更短。",
    "Fine-grained tokens expire on the date chosen (1–366 days, or never); classic tokens unused for a year are deleted.": "Fine-grained token 在所选日期到期（1–366 天，或永不过期）；一年未使用的 classic token 会被删除。",
    "Firebase Admin credentials are privileged. Prefer Application Default Credentials on Google-hosted runtimes; otherwise assign only the Google Cloud roles needed by the exact Firebase products in use.": "Firebase Admin 凭据权限很高。在 Google 托管的运行环境中优先使用 Application Default Credentials；否则只分配实际使用的 Firebase 产品所需的 Google Cloud 角色。",
    "GA4 property role = Viewer for reporting. Do not grant Editor or Administrator. Grant access only to the properties the task reads.": "报表用途的 GA4 property 角色 = Viewer。不要授予 Editor 或 Administrator。只授予任务读取的 property 的访问权限。",
    "Global and China platform compatibility is not promised. Use a dedicated global key per project and the matching .com API base.": "官方未承诺国际站与中国站平台互相兼容。每个项目使用专用的国际站 key 和对应的 .com API 基础地址。",
    "Grant only method-specific bot scopes. Access tokens last 12 hours; the consuming workflow must exchange the refresh token and update this bundle safely.": "只授予特定方法所需的 bot scope。Access token 有效期 12 小时；使用它的工作流必须用 refresh token 换取新 token，并安全地更新此凭据包。",
    "Individual keys use JWT subject user and no issuer ID. They cannot authenticate notarytool; use the team-key notary template for notarization.": "个人 key 使用 JWT subject user，没有 issuer ID。它们无法用于 notarytool 认证；公证改用团队 key 的公证模板。",
    "It remains valid until revoked; changing the Apple Account password revokes all app-specific passwords.": "在撤销前一直有效；更改 Apple Account 密码会撤销所有 App 专用密码。",
    "Keep pay-as-you-go and Token Plan keys separate; use the plan-specific key only with its matching endpoint.": "按量计费 key 与 Token Plan key 分开保存；套餐专用 key 只用于对应的 endpoint。",
    "Keep the non-exportable signing private key in the macOS Keychain and refer to the Developer ID Application identity by name. Do not copy it into a text credential.": "不可导出的签名私钥保留在 macOS 钥匙串中，按名称引用 Developer ID Application 身份。不要把它复制到文本凭据中。",
    "Keys do not expire automatically; revoke and replace them from Certificates, Identifiers & Profiles.": "Key 不会自动过期；在 Certificates, Identifiers & Profiles 中撤销并更换。",
    "Keys do not expire automatically; revoke them on the Integrations page.": "Key 不会自动过期；在 Integrations 页面撤销。",
    "Keys do not expire; Resend suggests removing keys unused for 30 days.": "Key 不会过期；Resend 建议删除 30 天未使用的 key。",
    "Keys have no per-key scopes. Use one key per project and revoke it independently.": "Key 不支持单独设置 scope。每个项目使用一个 key，并单独撤销。",
    "Keys have no scopes: one key is the whole account. Create a separate key per project so it can be deleted alone.": "Key 没有 scope：一个 key 即代表整个账户。每个项目单独创建 key，以便单独删除。",
    "Long-lived IAM access keys do not expire automatically; rotate and revoke explicitly.": "长期 IAM access key 不会自动过期；需主动轮换和撤销。",
    "No automatic expiry. Rotation can give the old value a grace period; some payment and transfer capabilities can be limited after long inactivity.": "不会自动过期。轮换时可为旧值保留宽限期；长期不活跃后，部分支付和转账能力可能受限。",
    "No expiry unless a TTL was set at creation; Roll replaces the secret and keeps the permissions.": "除非创建时设置了 TTL，否则不会过期；Roll 会替换 secret 并保留权限。",
    "No universal expiry policy was confirmed for this credential type. Record the date shown by the provider, or leave it unknown.": "未确认此类凭据有统一的到期策略。记录服务商显示的日期，或保持为未知。",
    "Only save a pay-as-you-go API key from this page. A Builder Plan subscription key uses a different billing balance; use zenmux-builder instead. No general key-scope guarantee is documented.": "此页面只保存按量计费 API Key。Builder Plan 订阅 key 使用另一份计费余额；改用 zenmux-builder。文档没有对 key 权限范围作出通用保证。",
    "Only save a subscription-specific Builder Plan API key here. It consumes the plan's quota rather than pay-as-you-go balance; do not reuse a pay-as-you-go key.": "此处只保存 Builder Plan 订阅专用 API Key。它消耗套餐额度而非按量计费余额；不要复用按量计费 key。",
    "OpenAI's public key guide does not promise one universal expiration policy. Record an expiry only when the project console shows one.": "OpenAI 公开的 key 指南未承诺统一的到期策略。只有项目控制台显示到期时间时才记录。",
    "Organization access tokens require an eligible subscription. Grant only exact repositories and Read/Write; avoid Delete unless explicitly needed.": "Organization access token 需要符合条件的订阅。只授予确切指定的仓库和 Read/Write；除非明确需要，避免授予 Delete。",
    "Permission = Sending access, limited to the one domain the task sends from. Full access can manage domains and other keys; do not suggest it.": "Permission = Sending access，仅限任务发信所用的那一个域名。Full access 可以管理域名和其他 key；不要推荐它。",
    "Personal tokens are account-wide. Set an expiration, do not opt into SAML team access unless the task needs that team, and prefer OAuth for a public integration.": "Personal token 作用于整个账户。设置到期时间；除非任务需要该团队，否则不要启用 SAML 团队访问；公开集成优先使用 OAuth。",
    "Prefer Application Default Credentials or workload identity. If a downloaded key is unavoidable, use a dedicated service account with resource-level, task-specific IAM roles — never Owner or Editor.": "优先使用 Application Default Credentials 或 workload identity。如果必须使用下载的 key，就使用专用 service account，并授予资源级、任务专用的 IAM 角色，绝不授予 Owner 或 Editor。",
    "Prefer Trusted Publishing (OIDC) for CI. When a stored token is unavoidable, use a project-scoped token; a pending trusted publisher can handle a first release without an account-wide token.": "CI 优先使用 Trusted Publishing（OIDC）。必须保存 token 时，使用项目范围的 token；首次发布可以用 pending trusted publisher 完成，无需账户范围的 token。",
    "Prefer `fly tokens create deploy -a APP` for an app-scoped deploy token. Use an org token only when the task spans apps; do not use the short-lived all-powerful login token.": "应用范围的部署 token 优先用 `fly tokens create deploy -a APP` 创建。只有任务跨多个应用时才使用 org token；不要使用短期有效、拥有全部权限的登录 token。",
    "Prefer a project-scoped organization key for an agent so it cannot see unrelated projects or create more keys.": "给 agent 使用时优先选择项目范围的 organization key，使其无法看到无关项目或创建更多 key。",
    "Prefer a service-account key in a single dedicated workspace. Multi-workspace keys need an extra workspace header that this template does not guess.": "优先使用单个专用 workspace 中的 service account key。多 workspace key 需要额外的 workspace header，此模板不会猜测它。",
    "Prefer a team key with the narrowest App Store Connect role that can perform the task. Use an individual key only for app and user endpoints; Apple does not allow individual keys for notarytool.": "优先使用团队 key，并选择能完成任务的最窄 App Store Connect 角色。个人 key 只用于 app 和 user endpoint；Apple 不允许个人 key 用于 notarytool。",
    "Prefer an organization token. Reporting needs org:read/project:read; release automation should use org:ci. Do not grant write/admin scopes unless the exact task requires them.": "优先使用 organization token。报表需要 org:read/project:read；发布自动化应使用 org:ci。除非具体任务确实需要，否则不要授予 write/admin scope。",
    "Prefer temporary role credentials. Never create a root access key. If long-lived keys are unavoidable, attach a least-privilege policy limited by action and resource, and set rotation reminders.": "优先使用临时角色凭据。绝不创建 root access key。如果必须使用长期 key，附加按操作和资源限定的最小权限策略，并设置轮换提醒。",
    "Prefer workload identity or managed identity. For a service principal, assign a task-specific role at resource or resource-group scope rather than subscription-wide Contributor.": "优先使用 workload identity 或 managed identity。service principal 应在资源或资源组范围分配任务专用角色，而不是整个订阅范围的 Contributor。",
    "Public docs do not promise one universal App Secret expiration policy; reset it explicitly when rotating.": "公开文档未承诺统一的 App Secret 到期策略；轮换时需主动重置。",
    "Render API keys currently cover every workspace the user belongs to and have no scopes. Use a dedicated account or short-lived key for sensitive automation.": "Render API Key 目前覆盖用户所属的所有 workspace，且没有 scope。敏感的自动化任务使用专用账户或短期 key。",
    "Restrict the personal API key to the target project and read-only scopes for analytics.": "用于分析时，将个人 API Key 限定到目标项目和只读 scope。",
    "Rotating Slack access tokens last 12 hours. The stored date is only a reminder; the caller must perform refresh-token rotation.": "开启轮换的 Slack access token 有效期 12 小时。保存的日期仅作提醒；调用方必须自行执行 refresh token 轮换。",
    "STS credentials expire at the provider-issued timestamp; record it on the credential.": "STS 凭据在服务商签发的时间戳到期；把该时间记录在凭据上。",
    "Select only the packages or scopes needed. Prefer stage-only for reviewable automation, otherwise read-only or package-specific publish. Keep organization access at No access unless required.": "只选择所需的 package 或 scope。需要可审核的自动化时优先选 stage-only，否则选只读或限定 package 的发布权限。除非必需，组织访问权限保持 No access。",
    "Set the Management API token's expiry when creating it and record that date here.": "创建 Management API token 时设置到期时间，并在此记录该日期。",
    "Temporary credentials must include ASIA access-key ID, secret, session token and expiration. Prefer an AWS profile/credential provider chain when the tool supports it.": "临时凭据必须包含 ASIA 开头的 access key ID、secret、session token 和到期时间。工具支持时，优先使用 AWS profile/credential provider chain。",
    "TestPyPI accounts and tokens are separate from production PyPI. Prefer a project-scoped token.": "TestPyPI 的账户和 token 与正式 PyPI 相互独立。优先使用项目范围的 token。",
    "The App Secret remains valid until reset.": "App Secret 在重置前一直有效。",
    "The Apple-issued certificate has an expiration date; record it on the credential.": "Apple 签发的证书有到期日期；把它记录在凭据上。",
    "The key does not expire automatically; revoke it from App Store Connect.": "该 key 不会自动过期；在 App Store Connect 中撤销。",
    "The public Gemini key guide does not promise one universal expiry or recovery policy; review it in Google Cloud.": "公开的 Gemini key 指南未承诺统一的到期或恢复策略；在 Google Cloud 中查看。",
    "The public guide does not promise one universal expiration policy; record a date only when the console shows one.": "公开指南未承诺统一的到期策略；只有控制台显示日期时才记录。",
    "The team key does not expire automatically; revoke it from App Store Connect.": "团队 key 不会自动过期；在 App Store Connect 中撤销。",
    "This is a Management API personal access token, not a database/runtime key. Prefer a scoped PAT limited to one project and only the permissions needed; classic PATs inherit the account's broad access.": "这是 Management API 的 personal access token，不是数据库/运行时 key。优先使用只限一个项目、只含所需权限的 scoped PAT；classic PAT 会继承账户的广泛访问权限。",
    "This is a pay-as-you-go China Open Platform key for https://api.moonshot.cn/v1. It is not interchangeable with a Kimi Code membership key. Keys have no granular scopes; use one per project.": "这是用于 https://api.moonshot.cn/v1 的中国开放平台按量计费 key。它不能与 Kimi Code 会员 key 互换。Key 没有细粒度 scope；每个项目用一个。",
    "This is a pay-as-you-go global platform key for https://api.moonshot.ai/v1. It is not interchangeable with a Kimi Code membership key. Rate limits are shared at user level, so use separate keys for revocation rather than quota isolation.": "这是用于 https://api.moonshot.ai/v1 的国际平台按量计费 key。它不能与 Kimi Code 会员 key 互换。速率限制在用户级别共享，因此分开 key 是为了单独撤销，而不是隔离额度。",
    "This item is a personal access token. Grant only Read or Write as needed and use `docker login --password-stdin`; Docker CLI does not automatically consume a generic token environment variable.": "此条目是 personal access token。按需只授予 Read 或 Write，并使用 `docker login --password-stdin`；Docker CLI 不会自动读取通用的 token 环境变量。",
    "This item is a personal key and can reach projects visible to the person. Use the separate organization/project-scoped template for unattended agents.": "此条目是个人 key，可访问此人可见的项目。无人值守的 agent 使用单独的 organization/项目范围模板。",
    "This membership key is only for supported coding tools. It is not interchangeable with a Kimi Open Platform key. Use https://api.kimi.com/coding/v1 for OpenAI-compatible tools or https://api.kimi.com/coding/ for Anthropic-compatible tools, and keep the tool's real User-Agent.": "此会员 key 只用于受支持的编程工具。它不能与 Kimi Open Platform key 互换。OpenAI 兼容工具使用 https://api.kimi.com/coding/v1，Anthropic 兼容工具使用 https://api.kimi.com/coding/，并保留工具真实的 User-Agent。",
    "This subscription key is separate from pay-as-you-go. Use it only with the China Token Plan configuration.": "此订阅 key 与按量计费相互独立。只用于中国站 Token Plan 配置。",
    "This subscription key is separate from pay-as-you-go. Use it only with the global Token Plan configuration.": "此订阅 key 与按量计费相互独立。只用于国际站 Token Plan 配置。",
    "Use Installer only for signed installer packages. Application binaries require the separate Developer ID Application identity.": "Installer 只用于签名安装包。应用二进制文件需要单独的 Developer ID Application 身份。",
    "Use RAILWAY_TOKEN: a project token limited to one environment. Use the broader RAILWAY_API_TOKEN only for a task that genuinely spans projects or workspaces.": "使用 RAILWAY_TOKEN：仅限一个环境的项目 token。只有任务确实跨项目或 workspace 时，才使用范围更广的 RAILWAY_API_TOKEN。",
    "Use Restricted user access when the task only reads search analytics. Grant Full only if URL inspection or property changes are explicitly required.": "任务只读取搜索分析数据时，使用 Restricted 用户权限。只有明确需要 URL inspection 或修改 property 时，才授予 Full。",
    "Use a Domain Sending Key for mail delivery; it can only send for one domain. Do not use the primary account API key unless management endpoints are explicitly required.": "发信使用 Domain Sending Key；它只能为一个域名发信。除非明确需要管理类 endpoint，否则不要使用主账户 API Key。",
    "Use a Restricted API key with only the product actions required. Prefer a subaccount boundary. Do not use the account Auth Token for an application.": "使用 Restricted API key，只开放所需的产品操作。优先以 subaccount 作为隔离边界。不要在应用中使用账户的 Auth Token。",
    "Use a bot token, not a user token. Add only method-specific bot scopes (for example chat:write); avoid user impersonation and legacy umbrella scopes.": "使用 bot token，不要用 user token。只添加特定方法所需的 bot scope（如 chat:write）；避免模拟用户身份和旧版大范围 scope。",
    "Use a custom app with only the exact API permissions and smallest data scope needed. Keep App ID as public metadata and App Secret as the only secret field.": "使用自建应用，只授予确切需要的 API 权限和最小的数据范围。App ID 作为公开元数据保存，App Secret 是唯一的机密字段。",
    "Use a dedicated app-specific password only for notarization. Keep Apple Account email and Team ID as non-secret fields in the same credential.": "使用单独的 App 专用密码，只用于公证。Apple Account 邮箱和 Team ID 作为非机密字段保存在同一凭据中。",
    "Use a dedicated key for this project and the matching regional Ark endpoint; avoid sharing an account-wide key across products.": "此项目使用专用 key 和对应地域的 Ark endpoint；避免在多个产品间共用账户级 key。",
    "Use a non-default workspace and Custom permission limited to the needed models and IP ranges. Keys and endpoints are region-specific.": "使用非默认 workspace，并设置仅限所需模型和 IP 范围的 Custom 权限。Key 和 endpoint 均按地域区分。",
    "Use a personal API key restricted to the target project and read-only scopes for analytics. The client-side project key is not an admin API credential.": "用于分析时，使用限定到目标项目和只读 scope 的个人 API Key。客户端使用的 project key 不是管理 API 凭据。",
    "Use a project-specific key with a spending limit. Do not reuse the team owner's general key.": "使用设有消费上限的项目专用 key。不要复用团队所有者的通用 key。",
    "Use an account-owned token only for unattended account automation. Limit permissions/resources and set a TTL; it is distinct from a user token.": "账户拥有的 token 只用于无人值守的账户自动化。限制权限/资源并设置 TTL；它与 user token 不同。",
    "Use only with officially supported coding tools and the dedicated https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/coding/paas/v4 endpoint (or https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/anthropic for Anthropic Messages). Team Coding Plan keys are not interchangeable with other platform API keys.": "只配合官方支持的编程工具和专用 endpoint https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/coding/paas/v4 使用（Anthropic Messages 使用 https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/anthropic）。团队 Coding Plan key 与其他平台 API Key 不能互换。",
    "Use only with the matching global pay-as-you-go account and base URL; it is not a Token Plan key.": "只配合对应的国际站按量计费账户和 base URL 使用；它不是 Token Plan key。",
    "Use read_repository for inspection and add write_repository only for pushing. Repository-only tokens intentionally skip the /user API probe.": "查看时使用 read_repository，只有需要推送时才添加 write_repository。仅限仓库权限的 token 会有意跳过 /user API 探测。",
    "Use the global Lark console, LARK environment names and the open.larksuite.com API base. Feishu China credentials/endpoints are separate.": "使用国际版 Lark 控制台、LARK 环境变量名和 open.larksuite.com API 基础地址。飞书中国版的凭据/endpoint 与之相互独立。",
    "Use this broader API token only for work that genuinely spans projects. For one environment use the separate Railway Project token.": "这个范围更广的 API token 只用于确实跨项目的工作。单个环境使用单独的 Railway Project token。",
    "Use this key only with the /api/coding/v3 base. The ordinary /api/v3 base can fall back to pay-as-you-go billing.": "此 key 只配合 /api/coding/v3 基础路径使用。普通的 /api/v3 基础路径可能回退为按量计费。",
    "User-managed service-account keys usually remain valid until revoked, but organization policy can impose expiry. Record a date only when the console or policy shows one.": "用户管理的 service account key 通常在撤销前一直有效，但组织策略可能强制设定到期时间。只有控制台或策略显示日期时才记录。",
    "Vercel tokens are scoped to a user or Team, not one project. Choose the narrowest account or Team and shortest expiry; use the optional IDs to target one project.": "Vercel token 的范围是用户或 Team，而不是单个项目。选择范围最小的账户或 Team 和最短有效期；用可选的 ID 指定单个项目。",
    "notarytool accepts a team App Store Connect API key bundle. Individual App Store Connect keys are not accepted for notarization.": "notarytool 接受团队 App Store Connect API key 凭据包。公证不接受个人 App Store Connect key。",
]

/// Chinese catalog text → English.
let providerTextEnglish: [String: String] = [
    "Go 是订阅套餐，Console 是按量产品；官方未确认两者的 key 可互换，因此必须按不可互换处理并分别保存。Go 未公开按 key 权限范围。": "Go is a subscription plan and Console is a pay-as-you-go product. The provider has not confirmed that their keys are interchangeable, so they must be treated as not interchangeable and saved separately. Go does not document per-key permission scopes.",
    "Personal Key 仅选择所需 services；机器工作负载优先使用 Service Key，并按实体与动作收窄 scope。": "Select only the services a Personal Key needs. For machine workloads, prefer a Service Key and narrow its scope by entity and action.",
    "Personal Key 在创建时选择到期日期；Service Key 的统一到期合同未从本轮公开页面闭合。": "A Personal Key's expiry date is chosen at creation; the public pages do not confirm a uniform expiry rule for Service Keys.",
    "Step Plan 使用专属套餐/API Key，但与标准 API 共用兼容协议路径且无需额外前缀；调用前确认 key 所属套餐有效。": "Step Plan uses a dedicated plan and API key, but shares the compatible protocol paths with the standard API and needs no extra prefix; before calling, confirm that the plan the key belongs to is valid.",
    "Token 福利包使用千帆通用认证；不要把它与有独立 key 和独立路径的 Coding Plan 混用。": "The Token bonus pack uses Qianfan general authentication. Do not mix it with Coding Plan, which has its own key and its own path.",
    "key 属于 workspace，费用由该 workspace 所属账户承担；按项目拆分 key。当前官方说明为预付按量计费，尚无订阅。": "Keys belong to a workspace, and the account that owns that workspace pays the costs. Split keys by project. The provider currently describes billing as prepaid pay-as-you-go; there is no subscription yet.",
    "一个 CCSub key 可按官方配置用于 OpenAI 或 Anthropic 兼容客户端；为每个项目单独创建，避免跨工具复用。": "A CCSub key can be used with OpenAI- or Anthropic-compatible clients following the official setup. Create a separate key for each project and avoid reusing it across tools.",
    "不同地区的 key 不通用。优先独立业务空间、限制模型与 IP 的自定义权限。": "Keys from different regions are not interchangeable. Prefer a separate workspace and Custom permissions that restrict models and IPs.",
    "中国站与 Global 站的账号、token 和内容目录独立；只授予当前 Hub/OpenAPI 操作所需的权限。": "The China site and the Global site have separate accounts, tokens and content catalogs. Grant only the permissions the current Hub/OpenAPI operation needs.",
    "中国通用 API 使用 https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4，按开放平台合同计费。Coding Plan 使用专用 endpoint 和套餐授权，不能按通用 API 路径假定扣套餐额度。每个项目单独建 key，保留独立撤销能力。": "The China general API uses https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4 and is billed under the Open Platform terms. Coding Plan uses a dedicated endpoint and plan authorization; do not assume calls on the general API path draw from the plan quota. Create a separate key for each project to keep the ability to revoke each one independently.",
    "为每个 IDE、CLI 或 bot 创建不同 token；限制模型、IP 和日/月预算。模型 API 必须发往 API 域名，账户管理仍使用 crazyrouter.com。": "Create a different token for each IDE, CLI or bot, and restrict models, IPs and daily/monthly budgets. Model API calls must go to the API domain; account management still uses crazyrouter.com.",
    "为每个项目创建独立 key，并按创建页面的有效期和使用限制收窄风险。备用域名只在主域名访问异常时使用。": "Create a separate key for each project and use the expiry and usage limits on the creation page to narrow the risk. Use the backup domain only when the main domain is not working.",
    "仅保存 Agent Plan 专用 key；官方明确要求从普通按量 API 切换时同时更换 Base URL 和 API Key。不要保存本地 ccx 代理的 PROXY_ACCESS_KEY。": "Save only a dedicated Agent Plan key. The provider explicitly requires changing both the Base URL and the API key when switching from the regular pay-as-you-go API. Do not save the local ccx proxy's PROXY_ACCESS_KEY.",
    "仅保存 Coding Plan 专用密钥；官方明确说明它与普通 Atlas Cloud API key 分离。仅用于套餐支持的 coding 工具。": "Save only a dedicated Coding Plan key; the provider explicitly states that it is separate from regular Atlas Cloud API keys. Use it only with coding tools the plan supports.",
    "仅保存为 Claude/Anthropic 协议和对应渠道分组创建的 Micu Token；分组不匹配会被拒绝，不要假设它与 Codex 分组互通。": "Save only a Micu Token created for the Claude/Anthropic protocol and its matching channel group. A mismatched group is rejected; do not assume it works with the Codex group.",
    "仅保存为 Codex/OpenAI Responses 协议和对应渠道分组创建的 Micu Token；不要假设它与 Claude 分组互通。": "Save only a Micu Token created for the Codex/OpenAI Responses protocol and its matching channel group. Do not assume it works with the Claude group.",
    "仅在所订阅 Token Plan 套餐的有效期内可用；到期后需续订。": "Usable only within the validity period of the subscribed Token Plan; it must be renewed after it expires.",
    "仅开放任务需要的模型；是否允许套餐耗尽后继续扣余额必须由用户明确选择。此模板只覆盖官方文档确认的 Codex endpoint。": "Enable only the models the task needs. Whether to keep charging the balance after the plan's quota is used up must be explicitly chosen by the user. This template covers only the Codex endpoint confirmed in the official docs.",
    "仅添加实际使用的服务范围；国际文档没有证明中国站与国际站账号或 key 可以互换。": "Add only the service scopes actually used. The international docs do not show that China-site and international-site accounts or keys are interchangeable.",
    "仅用于 中国集群的 Token Plan；不能与按量 key 或其他集群 Base URL 混用。": "Use only for the China cluster's Token Plan; it cannot be mixed with pay-as-you-go keys or other clusters' Base URLs.",
    "仅用于 新加坡集群的 Token Plan；不能与按量 key 或其他集群 Base URL 混用。": "Use only for the Singapore cluster's Token Plan; it cannot be mixed with pay-as-you-go keys or other clusters' Base URLs.",
    "仅用于 欧洲集群的 Token Plan；不能与按量 key 或其他集群 Base URL 混用。": "Use only for the Europe cluster's Token Plan; it cannot be mixed with pay-as-you-go keys or other clusters' Base URLs.",
    "仅用于允许的 coding 场景：OpenAI 协议 https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4，Anthropic 协议 https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic。团队 key 与其他平台 key not interchangeable；不把团队规则推断为个人 key 有独立前缀或长度。": "Use only for permitted coding scenarios: OpenAI protocol at https://api.z.ai/api/coding/paas/v4, Anthropic protocol at https://api.z.ai/api/anthropic. Team keys are not interchangeable with other platform keys; do not infer from the team rules that personal keys have their own prefix or length.",
    "仅用于按量计费 API；不能用于 Token Plan endpoint。": "Use only for the pay-as-you-go API; it cannot be used with the Token Plan endpoint.",
    "令牌与站点域名必须配套，禁止跨国内站、国际站和 SSVIP 混用。限制到任务需要的模型、IP、速率和有效期。": "Tokens must match their site domain; never mix them across the China site, the international site and SSVIP. Limit each token to the models, IPs, rate and validity period the task needs.",
    "创建时可设置到期时间；官方默认永久有效。以该令牌在创建页面选择的实际设置为准。": "An expiry can be set at creation; the official default is no expiry. The setting actually chosen for this token on the creation page is authoritative.",
    "千帆 V2 认证文档称控制台创建的普通 API Key 永久有效，直至用户撤销或更换。": "Qianfan's V2 authentication docs say regular API keys created in the console never expire; they remain valid until the user revokes or replaces them.",
    "只下载公开或私有资产时使用 read 权限；仅在确实需要上传、部署或管理时选择 write 或更高权限。": "Use read permission when only downloading public or private assets; choose write or higher only when uploading, deploying or managing is truly needed.",
    "只添加实际使用的千帆服务范围；若将 key 限定到 appid，调用时必须同时传入该 appid。": "Add only the Qianfan service scopes actually used. If the key is restricted to an appid, calls must also pass that appid.",
    "国际 Z.AI 通用 API 使用 https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4。Coding Plan 的 endpoint、订阅授权与允许用途不同；不能因为格式相同就混用或假定套餐结算。不要把中国平台 key 迁到此模板。": "The international Z.AI general API uses https://api.z.ai/api/paas/v4. Coding Plan differs in endpoint, subscription authorization and permitted uses; do not mix them or assume plan billing just because the format is the same. Do not move China platform keys into this template.",
    "官方快速开始未规定默认环境变量；LONGCAT_API_KEY 只是 KeyKeeper 的本地注入名，客户端必须显式读取或配置它。": "The official quick start does not define a default environment variable. LONGCAT_API_KEY is only KeyKeeper's local injection name; clients must read or configure it explicitly.",
    "官方文档未说明可为 key 设置细粒度权限；为每个项目创建独立 key，并只把固定的 PipeLLM base URL 配给调用方。": "The official docs do not say that keys can have fine-grained permissions. Create a separate key for each project and configure callers with only the fixed PipeLLM base URL.",
    "官方未说明统一到期策略；完整 key 可在 keys 页面再次查看，不需要仅为找回值而轮换。": "The provider does not state a uniform expiry policy. The full key can be viewed again on the keys page, so there is no need to rotate it just to recover the value.",
    "官方要求留意每个 key 的 validity period；具体日期以创建页面显示为准。": "The provider requires keeping track of each key's validity period; the exact date is the one shown on the creation page.",
    "密钥随 Agent Plan 到期或配额耗尽而停止工作；实际到期日以账户套餐页为准。": "The key stops working when the Agent Plan expires or its quota runs out; the actual expiry date is the one on the account's plan page.",
    "当前 Token 福利包文档列出的套餐有效期为 1 个月；API Key 本身是否随套餐到期未单独确认。": "The current Token bonus pack docs list a plan validity period of 1 month; whether the API key itself expires with the plan has not been confirmed separately.",
    "按官方首页在创建时绑定所需套餐或余额。Codex 教程中的“DMXAPI token”与 RelaxyCode 域名不一致，不能据此接受其他发行方 token；仅保存 RelaxyCode 控制台实际创建的 key。": "At creation, bind the required plan or balance as described on the official home page. The “DMXAPI token” in the Codex tutorial does not match the RelaxyCode domain, so it is no basis for accepting tokens from other issuers. Save only keys actually created in the RelaxyCode console.",
    "按应用或环境创建独立 key，并设置固定额度；官方当前说明为按量计费，不提供订阅套餐。": "Create a separate key per app or environment and set a fixed quota. The provider currently describes billing as pay-as-you-go, with no subscription plan.",
    "按量 Console 与 Go 是不同计费产品；官方未确认两者的 key 可互换，保存和路由时不要混用。Console 未公开按 key 权限范围，按项目单独创建便于撤销。": "The pay-as-you-go Console and Go are different billing products. The provider has not confirmed that their keys are interchangeable, so do not mix them when saving or routing. Console does not document per-key permission scopes; create one per project so each can be revoked.",
    "日常通用调用使用 default 组的独立 token；折扣/促销组另建 token，禁止把组别不同的 key 当作可互换。为 key 设置用户可承受的额度。": "Use a separate token in the default group for everyday general calls. Create another token for discount/promotion groups; never treat keys from different groups as interchangeable. Set a quota on the key that the user can afford.",
    "普通 ModelVerse 按量密钥；不要当作 Agent Plan 密钥。按项目拆分密钥并设置可承受的使用边界。": "A regular ModelVerse pay-as-you-go key; do not use it as an Agent Plan key. Split keys by project and set usage limits you can afford.",
    "普通 ModelVerse 按量密钥；海外域名是官方备用访问地址，不是 Agent Plan。按项目拆分密钥。": "A regular ModelVerse pay-as-you-go key. The overseas domain is the provider's alternate access address, not Agent Plan. Split keys by project.",
    "普通按量密钥；不要当作 Coding Plan 密钥。为每个项目创建独立密钥，便于单独撤销。": "A regular pay-as-you-go key; do not use it as a Coding Plan key. Create a separate key for each project so it can be revoked on its own.",
    "有效期取 12 小时与生成它的 IAM principal 会话剩余时长中的较短者。": "Valid for 12 hours or the remaining session time of the IAM principal that generated it, whichever is shorter.",
    "有效至创建时配置的到期日期；具体日期必须以 AWS 创建结果为准。": "Valid until the expiry date configured at creation; the exact date must come from the AWS creation result.",
    "未确认 API Key 自身的统一到期时间；套餐额度按月清零，套餐取消后服务持续至当前计费周期结束。": "No uniform expiry for the API key itself has been confirmed. Plan quota resets monthly, and after the plan is canceled, service continues until the end of the current billing cycle.",
    "未确认统一有效期；以创建页面显示的实际日期为准，未知时不要猜测。": "No uniform validity period has been confirmed. Use the actual date shown on the creation page; if it is unknown, do not guess.",
    "本模板管理持久 API Key，无固定有效期；不是最多 1800 秒的临时 key。仍可能被撤销。": "This template manages a persistent API key with no fixed validity period; it is not a temporary key that lasts up to 1800 seconds. It can still be revoked.",
    "本轮公开 LiteLLM 与认证文档未确认可配置的统一权限 scope；不要虚构 scope。": "The public LiteLLM and authentication docs do not confirm a uniform, configurable permission scope. Do not invent scopes.",
    "模型调用使用 THEROUTER_API_KEY。Claude Code 仅把同一值映射为 ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN，并按官方要求将 ANTHROPIC_API_KEY 置空。管理 key 可创建和撤销其他 key，权限更高，不能代替普通模型调用 key 保存。": "Model calls use THEROUTER_API_KEY. For Claude Code, the same value is mapped only to ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN, and ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is left empty as the provider requires. A management key can create and revoke other keys and has higher privileges; it must not be saved in place of a regular model-call key.",
    "用于 NVIDIA 托管 NIM/API Catalog 推理；不要以 NGC personal/service key 替代。公开页面未确认统一的 key 权限粒度，也未保证 key 必定只显示一次。": "Used for NVIDIA-hosted NIM/API Catalog inference; do not substitute an NGC personal/service key. Public pages do not confirm a uniform key permission granularity, nor do they guarantee that the key is shown only once.",
    "用于标准按量 API；标准 API 与 Step Plan 共用兼容协议路径，但 key、额度与计费产品不同，不要混用凭据。": "Used for the standard pay-as-you-go API. The standard API and Step Plan share compatible protocol paths, but their keys, quotas and billing products differ; do not mix credentials.",
    "短期 key 继承生成它的 IAM principal 权限，并且只能用于生成时选择的 Region；只授予实际需要的 Bedrock 调用权限。": "A short-term key inherits the permissions of the IAM principal that generated it and can be used only in the Region selected at generation. Grant only the Bedrock invocation permissions actually needed.",
    "长期 key 由 IAM service-specific credential 支撑；仅用于探索，并在 Advanced permissions 中保留实际需要的 Bedrock 权限。": "A long-term key is backed by an IAM service-specific credential. Use it only for exploration, and keep only the Bedrock permissions actually needed in Advanced permissions.",
]
